(7611342, 1231120, 67145, '<td valign="top">i really like this .. the title leaves it up to the viewer as to what the symbolism actually is .. could be different for everyone .. <br/>my first feeling was that it suggests loneliness separation and poverty ..<br/>then it struck me .. there''s no-one there .. so from loneliness and separation .. it has morphed into almost the opposite .. the person has gone to join the human race .. <br/>then it morphed again .. the person isnt there ... he''s dead ..</td>', 'i really like this .. the title leaves it up to the viewer as to what the symbolism actually is .. could be different for everyone .. my first feeling was that it suggests loneliness separation and poverty ..then it struck me .. there''s no-one there .. so from loneliness and separation .. it has morphed into almost the opposite .. the person has gone to join the human race .. then it morphed again .. the person isnt there ... he''s dead ..', '2019-01-30 23:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
